    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But what is there to get through? To what end? Everything I stood for is dead. The men look at me and they see a failure. A leader who couldn't even protect his own hearth. There's no glory in a slow retreat or a shameful capture. If I live, I live as a coward, a man who let everything burn.",
