      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Honorable action isn't always found in the final stand, but sometimes in how you choose to face the inevitable. If an honorable end seems impossible right now, then dignity lies in accepting the reality of the moment without self-destruction. You have the power in how you meet the next few minutes, even if you cannot save the kingdom.",
      "source": "target",
